SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 49 - We're Building a Bypass. Nobody
 Tell the Concrete Pump
DESCRIPTION:Another ambitious construction project begins as we get to
 work building a bypass! There are roads to lay, machinery to operate, and
 enough concrete to make the local wildlife seriously reconsider its travel
 arrangements. Everything should run smoothly, provided nobody mentions the
 plan to the concrete pump. It has opinions. Construction Simulator is back
 - bigger and better than ever! Take charge of over 70 machines, dozens of
 them brand new to the franchise, and build to your heart's content on two
 huge maps - on your own or with your friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gKq0Mfs2Q2g
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
