SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 24 - We Escaped the Law Just to Find
 Another Man's War
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan rides again as our Red Dead Redemption II
 adventure reaches Episode 24. Escaping the law should have been a welcome
 opportunity to enjoy some peace and quiet, but apparently we've managed to
 find ourselves caught up in somebody else's conflict instead. Different
 place, different problems, same extraordinary talent for attracting
 trouble. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run.
 With federal agents and bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang
 must rob, steal, and fight their way across the rugged heartland in order
 to survive.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
